OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens showcases superb
OL,12,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,13,     Fbeyond, including Samuel Barber's
OL,14,     Fintimate Violin Concerto performed
OL,15,     Fby Augustin Hadelich.
OL,16,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,17,     FFrom York Minster with members of
OL,18,     Fthe Rodolfus Choral Course, with
OL,19,     Fmusic by Richard Allain, Joseph
OL,20,     FTwist, Bairstow and Elgar.
