OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Greatest
OL,6,G     Showstoppers
OL,7,     F3/4. Donald Macleod follows Polish
OL,8,     Fpianist Maria Szymanowska as she
OL,9,     Fstrikes out on her own.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FPetroc introduces live music from
OL,12,     FLe Vent du Nord and chats to music
OL,13,     Fhistorian Ashley Kahn about John
OL,14,     FColtrane's musical legacy on the
OL,15,     F100th anniversary of his birth.
OL,16,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,17,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,18,     Fsoundscape of classical favourites
OL,19,     Ffrom Canteloube to Tchaikovsky.
