OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FJohn Storgards and the BBC
OL,7,     FPhilharmonic in music by Sibelius
OL,8,     Fand Wagner. They are joined by
OL,9,     FJames McVinnie for Gabriella
OL,10,     FSmith's organ concerto 'Breathing
OL,11,     FForests'.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,13,     FCarlos Santana remembers how he
OL,14,     Fwas inspired by the spiritual jazz
OL,15,     Fof John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,16,     FAshley Kahn.
OL,17,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,18,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Feverything in between.
